# Compiled binaries
/bonnie
/output/
/dist/

# Nix build symlinks
/result
/result-*

# direnv cache and the local .env it loads
/.direnv/
/.env

# Credentials a live test writes: a channel's tokens or key and any env
# file put beside them (see examples/github-bot, examples/slack-bot).
/.secrets/
*.pem

# go-task cache
/.task/

# Scratch agent trees. The repository root is a Go library, not an agent tree:
# a stray instructions.md, skills/, or workspace/ here belongs to someone's
# `bonnie init .` and is not part of the project.
/instructions.md
/skills/
/workspace/
/bonnie_gen.go

# Test and coverage output
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Local run journals and sandbox workspaces. The default journal root is
# .bonnie, and it holds full conversation content in plain text.
.bonnie/

# Journal files written outside the default root by an ad-hoc run. The JSONL
# form is pre-T-025 and only appears in a journal that has not been imported
# yet; journal.db is the current one.
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.imported
journal.db
journal.db-wal
journal.db-shm

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
